    ],
    "text": "0: Adjacency matrix [MATH A] for each [MATH \\langle\\tau(s),\\phi(e),\\tau(t)\\rangle] relation pair; Output node Set [MATH OS] ; Sample number [MATH n] per node type; Sample depth [MATH L] ."
  },
  {
