    ],
    "text": "0: Budget [MATH B] storing nodes for each type with normalized degree; Added node [MATH t] ; Adjacency matrix [MATH A] for each [MATH \\langle\\tau(s),\\phi(e),\\tau(t)\\rangle] relation pair; Sampled node set [MATH NS] ."
